    "detailed_description": "<h1>MORE FROM US</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Step into Terry\u2019s flip flops in this short and delightfully sweet adventure of self-discovery as he uncovers what it means to be an inhabitant of <strong>\u2728Sprankelwater\u2728</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2238040/extras/188894914eae93bddf834742cda1819c.poster.avif?t=1734089791\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2238040/extras/188894914eae93bddf834742cda1819c.webm?t=1734089791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2238040/extras/188894914eae93bddf834742cda1819c.mp4?t=1734089791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore a densely packed, tiny open world town at any pace and in any way you like. Slow, fast, by foot, by car, by paraglider! It\u2019s up to you.<br></li><li>Uncover a wholesome story through hilarious interactions with weird Sprankelwaterians.<br></li><li>Collect TURBO JUNK and upgrade the boost capacity of Terry\u2019s very own car.<br></li><li>Catch insects, dig holes, destroy cars, become rich, wear hats.<br></li><li>Listen to a joyful and heart-warming soundtrack from the composer of Wuppo.</li></ul><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2238040/extras/89e81298e62e6a4917bc56ffb2474efe.poster.avif?t=1734089791\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2238040/extras/89e81298e62e6a4917bc56ffb2474efe.webm?t=1734089791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "Step into Terry\u2019s flip flops in this short and delightfully sweet adventure of self-discovery as he uncovers what it means to be an inhabitant of <strong>\u2728Sprankelwater\u2728</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2238040/extras/188894914eae93bddf834742cda1819c.poster.avif?t=1734089791\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2238040/extras/188894914eae93bddf834742cda1819c.webm?t=1734089791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2238040/extras/188894914eae93bddf834742cda1819c.mp4?t=1734089791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore a densely packed, tiny open world town at any pace and in any way you like. Slow, fast, by foot, by car, by paraglider! It\u2019s up to you.<br></li><li>Uncover a wholesome story through hilarious interactions with weird Sprankelwaterians.<br></li><li>Collect TURBO JUNK and upgrade the boost capacity of Terry\u2019s very own car.<br></li><li>Catch insects, dig holes, destroy cars, become rich, wear hats.<br></li><li>Listen to a joyful and heart-warming soundtrack from the composer of Wuppo.</li></ul><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2238040/extras/89e81298e62e6a4917bc56ffb2474efe.poster.avif?t=1734089791\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2238040/extras/89e81298e62e6a4917bc56ffb2474efe.webm?t=1734089791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
    "short_description": "Terry wants to launch himself into space using his new car. Doing something this cool and reckless will surely make him the talk of the town. Run, drive and glide through this small journey of big discoveries as Terry works towards achieving this goal.",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Korean",
